    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
    "long_instructions": "#Vision Board Creation\r\n\r\nCreate your AI vision board! Use what you discovered in your research to fill in all four sections:\r\n\r\n* **My Hopes** — what you want AI to do for your community\r\n* **My Fears** — what worries you, and who could get hurt\r\n* **My Role** — what you will do, ask, or check when you use AI\r\n* **Questions I'm Sitting With** — what your articles didn't answer\r\n\r\n##Tips:\r\n\r\n- Put your strongest ideas from your research on the board first.\r\n- Pair every image with words — a label, a caption, or a sticky note.\r\n- Check out the model board if you're not sure where to start.\r\n- Use the icons, shapes, notes, and sentence starters as needed — and feel free to add outside images or resources to give your board more depth.",
